  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Computes baked lightmap lighting contribution and conditionally
    blends it with dynamic light color.

    Samples the lightmap when enabled, applies
    a boosted baked term, combines it with the original light color, and outputs
    the final baked lighting contribution based on the LIGHTMAP_ON keyword.'
